### ============================================================
### Error cases — verify GlobalExceptionHandler output
### Each request should return the frozen ApiError envelope.
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 1

### 400 — validation error (blank title, with field details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?userId={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### 400 — validation error (title too long)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?userId={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
}

### 400 — malformed JSON (unclosed brace)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?userId={{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "bad json"

### 404 — task not found (nobody owns task id 99999)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/99999?userId={{userId}}

### 404 — user not found (userId 99999 doesn't exist)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?userId=99999g